<title>USA: Aluminum Assn revises up 1996 primary production.</title>
<headline>Aluminum Assn revises up 1996 primary production.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Aluminum Association said it upwardly revised its 1996 U.S. primary aluminum production to 3,577,492 tonnes from its original total of 3,576,726 tonnes.</p>
<p>Production in 1995 was 3,375,241 tonnes.</p>
<p>Output in December was 305,410 tonnes, with average daily production of 9,852 tonnes.</p>
<p>((New York Commodities 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
